        "date": "2026-10-25T17:19:18Z"
      },
      "message": "T4: TrialGPT baseline runs end to end on Qwen3-8B\n\nReproduces TrialGPT (Jin et al. 2024) with an open model instead of GPT-4,\nin src/trialguide/baselines/trialgpt/. Prompts and ranking formula are the\nreleased code's; model calls go through a cached, logged client\n(src/trialguide/llm/client.py; to be reconciled with T5). Adds an evaluation\nscript (NDCG@10, P@10, AUROC; the repo ships none), a SLURM script, and unit\ntests for the metrics.\n\nSmoke test on 3 SIGIR patients (43 pairs): NDCG@10 0.773 vs 0.620 for a\nrandom ranking, 0/86 unparsed outputs. See the README for every change from\nthe released code, including the empty-criteria-list fix.",
