      "message": "T4 review fixes: hf default backend, nltk, data/raw/trialgpt\n\n- LLM client defaults to the local hf backend instead of azure\n- nltk==3.9.2 added to requirements.txt (sentence splitting)\n- data folder defaults to data/raw/trialgpt, where scripts/download_data.sh\n  puts TrialGPT's files; the SLURM script no longer requires TRIALGPT_DATA\n- README: data location and the one-time NLTK tokenizer download",
